{"id":"c8ba441dc36f60de","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-adleman.md","title":"thm-adleman (Adleman Theorem)","display":"thm-adleman (Adleman Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"thm-adleman (Adleman Theorem)","label":"28-thm-adleman","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-adleman","Adleman Theorem","BPP is contained in P/poly"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-bpp]]","[[28-thm-bpp-amplification]]","[[28-df-p-poly]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 7.14 and proof; printed p.136; PDF p.162","source_printed_pages":"136","source_pdf_pages":"162","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"not-audited","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-adleman (Adleman Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-adleman"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-adleman</span><span>Adleman Theorem</span><span>BPP is contained in P/poly</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1165db05a0a23506\" href=\"?note=1165db05a0a23506\" title=\"28-thm-bpp-amplification\">28-thm-bpp-amplification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" href=\"?note=bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" title=\"28-df-p-poly\">28-df-p-poly</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 7.14 and proof; printed p.136; PDF p.162"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"136"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"162"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-audited"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\">\\(L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L\">\\(\\chi_L\\)</span> 为其特征函数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1165db05a0a23506\" href=\"?note=1165db05a0a23506\" title=\"28-thm-bpp-amplification\">28-thm-bpp-amplification</a> 对该语言机器独立重复得到的确定型随机带算法，使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(n)\">\\(m(n)\\)</span> 个随机位；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 为多项式有界。放大后每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 位输入错误概率至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-(n+1)}\">\\(2^{-(n+1)}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{m(n)}\">\\(U_{m(n)}\\)</span> 为随机种子均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{P/poly}\">\\(\\mathbf{P/poly}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" href=\"?note=bdb0c5ef1940ab80\" title=\"28-df-p-poly\">28-df-p-poly</a> 的电路族定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BPP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{P/poly}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{BPP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{P/poly}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{m(n)}}\\left[\\exists x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;A(x;r)\\ne\\chi_L(x)\\right]\\le2^n2^{-(n+1)}=\\tfrac12.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{m(n)}}\\left[\\exists x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;A(x;r)\\ne\\chi_L(x)\\right]\\le2^n2^{-(n+1)}=\\tfrac12.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists r_n\\in\\{0,1\\}^{m(n)}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;A(x;r_n)=\\chi_L(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists r_n\\in\\{0,1\\}^{m(n)}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;A(x;r_n)=\\chi_L(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 证据边界：本次复核联合界与固定种子推导；一般 Chernoff 放大及机器到电路的全部编码细节未完整独立审计。因此本条保留为有来源的定理记录，不作为本次已完整核验的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>R7 复核：上游有限 BPP 放大现在已有独立局部证明；本条仍保留机器到电路的完整编码未审计限制，故依赖资格继续为 false。</p>\n<p>这是定理 7.14 的概率法。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 共有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^n\">\\(2^n\\)</span> 个输入，联合坏种子概率小于 1；固定一个好种子后，将确定型多项式时间计算展开成多项式规模电路，得到非一致电路族。种子不要求可以统一高效计算。原稿 Assertion 内的英文证明连接句全部移至本节。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bpp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-bpp-amplification","status":"resolved","id":"1165db05a0a23506","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-bpp-amplification]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p-poly","status":"resolved","id":"bdb0c5ef1940ab80","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p-poly]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}$；$\\chi_L$ 为其特征函数，见 [[28-df-bpp]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-bpp-amplification","status":"resolved","id":"1165db05a0a23506","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 是由 [[28-thm-bpp-amplification]] 对该语言机器独立重复得到的确定型随机带算法，使用 $m(n)$ 个随机位；$m$ 为多项式有界。放大后每个 $n$ 位输入错误概率至多 $2^{-(n+1)}$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p-poly","status":"resolved","id":"bdb0c5ef1940ab80","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U_{m(n)}$ 为随机种子均匀分布；$\\mathbf{P/poly}$ 采用 [[28-df-p-poly]] 的电路族定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_L","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"m(n)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^{-(n+1)}","display":false},{"tex":"U_{m(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{P/poly}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BPP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{P/poly}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{m(n)}}\\left[\\exists x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;A(x;r)\\ne\\chi_L(x)\\right]\\le2^n2^{-(n+1)}=\\tfrac12.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists r_n\\in\\{0,1\\}^{m(n)}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;A(x;r_n)=\\chi_L(x).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^n","display":false}],"bytes":2051,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"类关系：[[28-thm-zpp-rp-intersection-corp]]、[[28-thm-rp-contained-np]]、[[28-thm-adleman]]、[[28-thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann]]。"}],"outgoing":["073a1a66749fa84e","1165db05a0a23506","bdb0c5ef1940ab80"]}